index 90e420d..0ad40b5 100644
--- a/docs/changelog.en.md
+++ b/docs/changelog.en.md
@@ -1,5 +1,25 @@
 # Changelog
 ---
+## Cleaner terminal UI (patch 498)
+
+At the owner's request, redundant information was removed from the interface:
+
+- terminal cards and the hacking window show **only the difficulty** — no
+  "N-letter password" text and no `0·4, 1·5, … 5·9` chip labels;
+- the "This room server does not support a shared hack…" line is gone from
+  the hacking window (the local fallback logic itself is unchanged);
+- the long internal hint about Hacker, attempts, word count, Science and Luck
+  was removed from both the form and the admin panel.
+
+**Difficulty `0` can no longer be set manually.** The form offers `1–5` only;
+effective difficulty 0 still appears on the player side when the Hacker perk
+lowers a level-1 terminal. Covered by a test: the engine returns
+`effectiveDifficulty: 0` and a four-letter password.
+
+The "lock the terminal after all attempts fail" label and its checkbox are now
+dark grey (`#222222`) instead of creamy yellow, so they read on the light grey
+form background. Installation: `docs/patch-498-install.md`.
+
 ## Canonical four attempts and the "sequence" board (patch 497)
 
 **Accepted by the owner.** Attempts are 4 again at every difficulty (ceiling 4);
diff --git a/docs/changelog.ru.md b/docs/changelog.ru.md
index aa0ed87..1815ef0 100644
--- a/docs/changelog.ru.md
+++ b/docs/changelog.ru.md
@@ -1,6 +1,26 @@
 # История изменений
 
 ---
+## Чистый интерфейс терминала (патч 498)
+
+По просьбе владельца убраны лишние сведения из интерфейса:
+
+- карточка и окно взлома показывают **только сложность** — больше нет
+  «пароль N букв» и перечисления `0·4, 1·5, … 5·9`;
+- из окна взлома убрана строка «Сервер комнат не поддерживает общий взлом…»
+  (сама логика локального резерва сохранена);
+- из формы и админ-панели убрана длинная служебная подсказка про Хакера,
+  попытки, число слов, Науку и Удачу.
+
+**Сложность `0` вручную создать нельзя.** В форме доступны только `1–5`;
+нулевая эффективная сложность по-прежнему возникает на стороне игрока,
+когда перк «Хакер» снижает сложность `1`. Проверено тестом: движок отдаёт
+`effectiveDifficulty: 0` и четырёхбуквенный пароль.
+
+Подпись «Заблокировать терминал после провала всех попыток» и галочка
+стали тёмно-серыми (`#222222`) вместо кремово-жёлтых — на светло-сером
+фоне формы они читаются. Установка: `docs/patch-498-install.md`.
+
 ## Канонические 4 попытки и доска «последовательности» (патч 497)
 
 **Принято владельцем.** Попыток снова 4 на всех сложностях (потолок 4);
diff --git a/docs/guides/admin-and-loot-trade.en.md b/docs/guides/admin-and-loot-trade.en.md
index c676399..64902ab 100644
--- a/docs/guides/admin-and-loot-trade.en.md
+++ b/docs/guides/admin-and-loot-trade.en.md
@@ -132,7 +132,7 @@ Issued cards display an active **«ISSUED»** badge for the Game Master.
 - The Game Master can put a **Lock (`🔒`)** on any chest or shop in a location and write a note (such as *«Lockpick — Difficulty 2»* or *«Requires Overseer's Key»*). Players see the locked entry and its requirement in the list, but cannot peek inside until they overcome the obstacle in play and the Game Master flips the lock to **«Unlocked» (`🔓`)**.
 
 #### Terminals & the Hacking Mini-Game
-- Tap **«Create terminal»** to set a name and description, choose a difficulty of `0–5` (password length `4–9`) and optionally lock the terminal after a failed hack.
+- Tap **«Create terminal»** to set a name and description, choose a difficulty of `1–5` and optionally lock the terminal after a failed hack. Difficulty `0` cannot be set manually: it only appears for a player with the **Hacker** perk lowering a level-1 terminal.
 - A terminal can be issued on its own or linked into a **Location**. Inside a location it is shown with a console icon (never as a chest) and opens the hacking window through the **«View»** and **«Hack»** buttons.
 - In the hacking window the player picks words and bracket combos: likeness `N/M` is learned only by spending an attempt. Attempts are always **4** at every difficulty, brackets never raise them above 4, and a full reset returns exactly to 4. With lockout enabled a failed run locks the terminal for the whole room, while a *Programmer’s Digest* magazine grants one more attempt.
 - The dictionary holds 12,308 real English words in six per-length files, so consecutive terminals no longer reuse the same candidates. At difficulty 1–5 the board is built from near-identical words: at least `L−3` shared letters and at most 2 matching positions, so the player must deduce the letter order. The password is picked inside the set, so neither the "most similar to everything" nor the "least similar" heuristic reveals it. Hints are capped at `3` matches for difficulty 0–2 and `2` for 3–5; at difficulty 4–5 at least four candidates survive any first wrong guess.
